{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":517496,"username":"BothLawyer62513","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.ageofempires.com/bothlawyer62513/{size}/29899_2.png","created_at":"2021-08-09T18:29:49.192Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow much gold does a single trade produce?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nI determined a perfect formula, whose deviation is less than 0.01%! (could be tested in game)\u003cbr\u003e\nThe map size is m, the trade distance is d,\u003cbr\u003e\nTrade unit work rate is w, the speed of trade unit is v,\u003cbr\u003e\nThe radius of trade building is R, the radius of trade unit is r,\u003cbr\u003e\nHorizontal coordinate difference of the center points of the farthest trade buildings is Δx, and their vertical coordinate difference is Δy.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/original/3X/6/9/6900963fd53ad1577c5dea80a6bd1139dfbbe33f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/6900963fd53ad1577c5dea80a6bd1139dfbbe33f\" title=\"image\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/9/6900963fd53ad1577c5dea80a6bd1139dfbbe33f_2_345x176.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"eYToigErQM5m8Pr0x5SjsJaYSEn\" width=\"345\" height=\"176\" srcset=\"https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/9/6900963fd53ad1577c5dea80a6bd1139dfbbe33f_2_345x176.png, https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/9/6900963fd53ad1577c5dea80a6bd1139dfbbe33f_2_517x264.png 1.5x, https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/9/6900963fd53ad1577c5dea80a6bd1139dfbbe33f_2_690x352.png 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/9/6900963fd53ad1577c5dea80a6bd1139dfbbe33f_2_10x10.png\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\n\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e999×512 22.8 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nExplanations:\u003cbr\u003e\n[★] is applicable to trade carts and cogs, suitable for all sizes of maps.\u003cbr\u003e\nParameters:\u003cbr\u003e\nTrade carts’ radius 0.25, work rate 0.23, speed 1\u003cbr\u003e\nTrade cogs’ radius 0.5, work rate 0.299, speed 1.32\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/original/3X/f/b/fbf3302643fc2cbcbc77646a82ad65d1ee4c3335.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zWQS8nY8rZBo5eAb1zWYVZY1i6x\" width=\"554\" height=\"71\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/original/3X/8/a/8a1fc93610531c4294f0b043af33fe2dc3ccdb9e.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"jHTZvwGaalTD4Wvf3PNUjcwzXmS\" width=\"554\" height=\"59\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*As a non-native speaker, it’s the best English I could use. Some words might be confusing.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2021-08-09T18:29:49.192Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":688,"reads":64,"readers_count":63,"score":3427.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":155315,"topic_slug":"an-accurate-formula-for-trade","primary_group_name":"Age_Insider","flair_name":"Age_Insider","flair_url":"//cdn.ageofempires.com/aoe-forums/original/3X/5/7/57ac945b03e64b35defdd85916e382852840f723.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":56,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Age Insider","title_is_gr